---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Car Accidents Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Injured in a car accident in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office fights for maximum compensation with trusted legal guidance. Free consultation."
  canonical="/car-accidents-lawyer-san-francisco/"
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark via-dark to-slate-900/80"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Car Accidents Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Car accidents can cause serious injuries and disrupt every aspect of your life. If you or a loved one has been injured in a crash caused by another driver's negligence, you need an experienced legal advocate on your side.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Car accidents are one of the most common causes of injury in the United States, and San Francisco's busy streets present unique risks for drivers. Whether you were rear-ended at a stoplight, struck by a speeding driver on the freeway, or hit by someone who ran a red light, the consequences can be severe. From whiplash and soft tissue injuries to traumatic brain injuries and broken bones, the physical, emotional, and financial toll can be overwhelming.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">At The Sulfab Law Office, we understand what is at stake after a car accident. Our San Francisco car accident lawyer provides dedicated representation for injury victims throughout the Bay Area. We handle every aspect of your claim, from dealing with insurance companies to gathering evidence and negotiating settlements. Our goal is to secure the maximum compensation available so you can focus on your recovery and move forward with confidence.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Experience Matters</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Experienced Representation for Car Accident Victims</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Building a strong car accident case requires a thorough investigation and a clear understanding of California's fault-based insurance system. Our San Francisco car accident attorney works closely with accident reconstruction experts, medical professionals, and other specialists to establish liability and demonstrate the full extent of your injuries and losses.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">We handle every aspect of your case, from preserving evidence and obtaining police reports to negotiating with insurance adjusters and, if needed, litigating in court. Insurance companies often try to minimize payouts or shift blame onto accident victims. We protect your rights and aggressively pursue the compensation you deserve.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Our firm is committed to holding negligent drivers accountable and ensuring that car accident victims receive the full compensation they are entitled to under California law. We will not settle for less than your case is worth.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Causes</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Common Causes of Car Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Car accidents can result from a wide range of negligent or reckless behaviors. Identifying the cause is essential to building a strong case.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Distracted driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Texting while driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Speeding</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Drunk driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Drug-impaired driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Reckless driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Failure to yield</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Running red lights / stop signs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Tailgating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Fatigued driving</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Unsafe lane changes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Poor vehicle maintenance</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Common Injuries</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Injuries From Car Accidents</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">Car accidents can result in a wide range of injuries, from minor to catastrophic. Our team understands the medical and legal complexities involved.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Whiplash and Neck Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Whiplash is one of the most common car accident injuries, caused by the sudden back-and-forth motion of the head and neck. Symptoms may not appear immediately but can lead to chronic pain and limited mobility.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Back and Spinal Cord Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Herniated discs, fractured vertebrae, and spinal cord damage can cause lasting pain, numbness, or paralysis. These injuries often require extensive medical treatment and may permanently alter your quality of life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Traumatic Brain Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Head trauma from a collision can result in concussions, contusions, or more severe traumatic brain injuries. Cognitive impairments, memory loss, and mood changes are common and may require lifelong care.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Broken Bones and Fractures</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Fractures to the arms, legs, ribs, and pelvis are common in car accidents. These injuries may require surgery, extensive rehabilitation, and time away from work to heal properly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50/50 p-6 pl-8 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-gold transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-3">Internal Injuries</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Blunt force trauma from a collision can cause internal bleeding, organ damage, or punctured lungs. These injuries are often life-threatening and require immediate medical attention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation Available After a Car Accident</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Victims of car accidents caused by negligence may be entitled to compensation for a variety of economic and non-economic damages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Coverage for emergency treatment, hospital stays, surgery, medication, rehabilitation, and ongoing medical care related to your accident injuries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Lost Wages and Earning Capacity</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for time missed from work, lost employment benefits, and reduced ability to earn income in the future due to injuries sustained.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Pain, Suffering and Other Damages</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Compensation for physical pain, emotional distress, loss of enjoyment of life, and other non-economic damages caused by your accident.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Contact a Car Accident Lawyer in San Francisco Today</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If you have been injured in a car accident caused by someone else's negligence, do not wait. Contact Sulfab Law Office today for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
